    "title": "Beat Piano - Music EDM",
    "description": "Beat Piano - Music EDM is <b>a rhythmic music game. It has an easy gameplay: Just feel the beats of music and tap the tiles.</b>With different kinds of music and awesome visual design, the game is a great choice for your casual time. \r\n\r\n\u203b <b>SIMPLE GAMEPLAY</b> \u203b (Beat Piano - Music EDM)\r\n\ud83d\udc96 Feel the beats and tap the piano tiles \r\n\ud83d\udc96 Do not tap the wrong areas!\r\n\ud83d\udc96 Headphones are recommended for a better experience \ud83c\udfa7\r\n\r\n\u203b <b>GAME FEATURES</b> \u203b (Beat Piano - Music EDM)\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Easy to learn but hard to master\r\n\ud83d\udc4d 700+ hot songs from all around the world! \r\n\ud83d\udc4d You can battle with other players! \r\n\ud83d\udc4d You can DIY the game skin! \r\n\r\nBeat Piano - Music EDM is a <b> rhythmic music game</b>. Come on and play it now, the music lovers!",
